        <div class="rs" data-stars></div>
        <p>"Caught a small coolant leak on my Audi before it became a big problem. They showed me the cracked flange with photos and replaced it same day. Honest work."</p>
        <div class="who"><span class="av">JL</span><div><b>Jenna L.</b><span>Audi Q5</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rcard reveal">
        <div class="rs" data-stars></div>
        <p>"Temp gauge was climbing on my GLE. They diagnosed a failing water pump fast and got me back on the road without the dealer wait or the dealer price."</p>
        <div class="who"><span class="av">TN</span><div><b>Trevor N.</b><span>Mercedes GLE</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
